{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/HWLC2LRHKui8Vi1fm7fWTQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:25.790580+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/HWLC2LRHKui8Vi1fm7fWTQ","html":"<div><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>点击蓝字</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>关注我们</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>为促进全国高校优秀大学生之间的学术交流，选拔有培养潜质的创新人才，上海理工大学东方泛血管器械创新学院特举办2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营。</span><span>本活动旨在为优秀学子提供深入了解前沿医疗科技的机会，搭建医工交叉领域的学术互动平台</span><span>。现将有关事项通知如下：</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>一、活动宗旨与学院特色</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>东方泛血管器械创新学院成立于2022年11月9日，是上海理工大学联合复旦大学附属中山医院葛均波院士团队和海军军医大学第一附属医院（上海长海医院）刘建民教授团队共同建立的二级学院。学院秉承 “From the doctors, by the engineers, for the patients” 的创新理念，面向人民生命健康和行业重大需求，构建了“产学研用”一体化的协同创新体系。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>学院依托医工交叉研究特色，研究方向覆盖：</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>· 植介入医疗器械</span></span></p><p><span><span>· 纳米生物医学与再生医学</span></span></p><p><span><span>· 医学影像与介入医疗机器人</span></span></p><p><span><span>· 生物医学光子学与超声医学</span></span></p><p><span><span>· 人工智能与大数据在医疗中的应用</span></span></p><p><span><span>· 神经科学与工程 </span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>学院拥有完整的人才培养体系，招收</span><span>生物医学工程（医学）学术型硕士、生物医学工程专业学位硕士及直博生</span><span>，为学生提供从基础研究到产业转化的全链条培养环境。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/1NwH5moFibze0VHAhpUmiaCSaic4ZibAppP6e3OjNZsBQlXj0ACAnLgicIJ3VZAAYh0gF0AGNKXrXtxGy62J6RWrwKw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/1NwH5moFibze0VHAhpUmiaCSaic4ZibAppP6EhRQWiapiaZKwMlAUu5smI9SacSljUCtRUZHuqmWibmuZnCNdRTQYNazQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>2</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>基本信息</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>我院将于6月底举办全国优秀大学生夏令营活动，诚挚邀请有意向报考上海理工大学东方泛血管器械创新学院相关专业研究生的国内外优秀本科生参与</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>报名时间：</span><strong><span>2025年6月24日9点前</span></strong></p><p><span>开营时间：</span><strong><span>2025年6月29日（如有变动，以学院官网通知为准）</span></strong></p><p><span>活动形式：</span><strong><span>本校学生、上海市内学生-线下学术营、外省市学生-线上学术营（采用腾讯视频会议方式进行）</span></strong></p><p><span>招生规模：</span><strong><span>100人以内</span></strong></p><p><span>招生学科：</span><strong><span>107200生物医学工程（医学）、085409生物医学工程</span></strong></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/1NwH5moFibze0VHAhpUmiaCSaic4ZibAppP6Gj1sNjGLVJkzxJdWj0W1JjRA3zyicnkmWUvcSMztk5oiaCOicnnxkjSrQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/1NwH5moFibze0VHAhpUmiaCSaic4ZibAppP6GCMs58c19icREoWxllDBAVheOMOrqQOn6np2LLibAjOOZg1tWqvq3p1w/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/1NwH5moFibze0VHAhpUmiaCSaic4ZibAppP6Gj1sNjGLVJkzxJdWj0W1JjRA3zyicnkmWUvcSMztk5oiaCOicnnxkjSrQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/1NwH5moFibze0VHAhpUmiaCSaic4ZibAppP6GCMs58c19icREoWxllDBAVheOMOrqQOn6np2LLibAjOOZg1tWqvq3p1w/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/1NwH5moFibze0VHAhpUmiaCSaic4ZibAppP6OSTwKGWaOL2wRDlPUuDodP4Yicr5zibYXMt5BtT9sJuGbDqejSnMrqgg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>3</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申报资格</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>1、热爱祖国，品德良好，身心健康，在校期间无违纪行为、未受过处分；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2、</span><strong><span>生物医学工程（含工学、医学）</span></strong><span>专业或相近专业背景，或对</span><strong><span>本学科有浓厚兴趣的三年级在校本科生（2026届本科毕业生）</span></strong><span>；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>3、学习成绩优秀，通过</span><strong><span>全国大学英语四级考试</span></strong><span>，有较好的专业素养和较强的创新能力。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/1NwH5moFibze0VHAhpUmiaCSaic4ZibAppP6Gj1sNjGLVJkzxJdWj0W1JjRA3zyicnkmWUvcSMztk5oiaCOicnnxkjSrQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/1NwH5moFibze0VHAhpUmiaCSaic4ZibAppP6GCMs58c19icREoWxllDBAVheOMOrqQOn6np2LLibAjOOZg1tWqvq3p1w/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/1NwH5moFibze0VHAhpUmiaCSaic4ZibAppP6Gj1sNjGLVJkzxJdWj0W1JjRA3zyicnkmWUvcSMztk5oiaCOicnnxkjSrQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/1NwH5moFibze0VHAhpUmiaCSaic4ZibAppP6GCMs58c19icREoWxllDBAVheOMOrqQOn6np2LLibAjOOZg1tWqvq3p1w/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qp