g&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/1NwH5moFibze0VHAhpUmiaCSaic4ZibAppP6GCMs58c19icREoWxllDBAVheOMOrqQOn6np2LLibAjOOZg1tWqvq3p1w/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/1NwH5moFibze0VHAhpUmiaCSaic4ZibAppP6OSTwKGWaOL2wRDlPUuDodP4Yicr5zibYXMt5BtT9sJuGbDqejSnMrqgg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>5</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请流程</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>SOON</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>登记→提交材料→等待公示</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>1、登记：</span></strong><span>请有意报名参加学术营的同学于</span><strong><span>2025年6月24日9点</span></strong><span>前扫描下方二维码或点击链接登记。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/1NwH5moFibze0VHAhpUmiaCSaic4ZibAppP6gmZhFOHx24G5hf6KyQq0fng8dI3ZKFbyK5XXHbk4FDIoWbPaibTmotA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>https://www.wjx.cn/vm/Qnj2ZVw.aspx</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2、</span><strong><span>提交材料：</span></strong><span>登记完成后将报名材料于</span><strong><span>2025年6月24日9点前</span></strong><span>发送至</span><strong><span>cdr0329@126.com</span></strong><span>邮箱。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>报名材料包含：</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>1）2025年上海理工大学东方泛血管器械创新学院全国优秀大学生夏令营申请表（见附件1）（请确保签字盖章完整）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>2）本人身份证正反面扫描件</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>3）在校成绩单加盖申请人所在学校教务部门或院系公章后扫描件</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>4）外语等级证书扫描件（如CET4、CET6成绩单）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>5）其他证明材料（各类获奖证书、荣誉证书、已发表论文等扫描件）</span></strong><span>  </span></p><p><span>        </span></p><p><span>请将以上材料转换成</span><strong><span>PDF格式</span></strong><span>（必须按照列出的顺序）、合并成一个PDF文件作为电子版材料，以“</span><strong><span>招生专业+姓名+手机号</span></strong><span>”命名，如“生物医学工程（医学）+张三+12345678987”，在规定时间内发送到指定的电子邮箱。请各位同学务必按照要求格式及顺序提交材料。逾期未提交电子版材料到指定电子邮箱者，网报信息无效，按放弃报名处理。</span></p><p><strong><span>注意：</span></strong><span>请申请人务必保证提交信息和材料真实准确，如有不实一经发现将直接取消参营资格以及相应的研究生招生优惠政策。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>3、公示</span></strong><span>：我院将成立审核小组，审核申请材料并遴选营员。遴选结果将在上海理工大学东方泛血管器械创新学院官网进行公示，请各位同学及时关注。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/1NwH5moFibze0VHAhpUmiaCSaic4ZibAppP6EhRQWiapiaZKwMlAUu5smI9SacSljUCtRUZHuqmWibmuZnCNdRTQYNazQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>优惠政策</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>我院将综合申请者提交的申请材料、夏令营综合考核，评选出“<span>优秀营员</span>”，在学院网站公布优秀营员信息。优秀营员将获得以下招生优惠政策：</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>1、获得所在学校推荐免试研究生资格的优秀营员，接收推免期间第一志愿申报我院，并按时按要求完成确认，可优先录取。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2、参加2026年全国硕士统一招生入学考试的优秀营员，第一志愿报考我院专业且考分达到我院2026年相应专业复试分数线，经复试选拔后，同等情况下优先录取。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>注：以上政策如有与上海理工大学相关政策冲突的地方，以学校政策为准。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>1、申请人所填报的各种信息和申请材料必须真实，若在申请、考核过程中存在弄虚作假或其他违规舞弊，一经发现即取消夏令营入营资格或“优秀营员”资格。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2、夏令营期间所有营员必须遵守上海理工大学有关规章制度和夏令营的要求与纪律，遵守夏令营的安排，按时参加活动，无故缺席者将被取消营员资格。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>3、本次夏令营活动不收取任何费用。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>联系电话：</span><strong><span>021-65067001</span></strong></p><p><span>联系邮箱：</span><strong><span>cdr0329@126.com</span></strong></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>更多内容请关注上海理工大学东方泛血管器械创新学院网站：https://opic.usst.edu.cn/。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section